  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a process budget line used to support the quality and development of the Irish Aid programme in Vietnam, Cambodia, Laos and Myanmar</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a process fund used to support programme staff salaries, research, strategic planning, oversight, monitoring and evaluation of Irish Aid programmes in Vietnam and Mekong Sub-Region. Funds are also allocated for public diplomacy to communicate about Irish Aid funded programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
